{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15mini_level_act15mini_st02",
  "groupId": "act15mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "冰原的女儿",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15mini/level_act15mini_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c781972573cedb7197b88e6eb8077a107e485f4d532ea4389c6a1e7f4d59e515",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚忍的萨米山地战士",
      "text": "失踪的拉瑟他们有消息了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的萨米山地战士",
      "text": "嗯，不用再找了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的萨米山地战士",
      "text": "邪魔来过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的萨米山地战士",
      "text": "那边的冰面上有法术凿出的痕迹，是一场苦战。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚忍的萨米山地战士",
      "text": "......霜槭的根系，令人尊敬的战士们，难道他们连遗体都没能留下吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的萨米山地战士",
      "text": "冰原上总有坏天气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚忍的萨米山地战士",
      "text": "最近这样的天气太多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的萨米山地战士",
      "text": "萨米早已借埃克提尔尼尔之口警告过我们，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的萨米山地战士",
      "text": "走吧，加固堡垒，盯紧每一道关隘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "（在笔记本上记录）“我们进入了冬牙群山，当前气温......零下三十一度。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "“目前为止，在萨米境内，还没有发现任何通讯基站......依然无法与马里亚姆主任的科考队取得联系。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "唉，不知道玛丽老师不在的话，这些笔记最后要报告到哪里去呢？他每次都能从我的调查报告里发现好多我应该更仔细观察的现象......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "“我们经过了此前科考记录中记载的，当地人在冬牙群山脚下、森林边缘的一个定居点。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "呼......就算只是脱掉了一层手套，还是好冷啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "需要帮忙吗，麦哲伦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "啊，没事的，西蒙娜姐，我马上就写完这份报告！很快就会从避风处出来，勇敢地走进风雪的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "刚刚记到哪里了？对了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "“那个定居点现在已经消失了。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "“我也向西蒙娜——”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "（匆匆划掉）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "“向同行的萨米人求证了这一点。萨米人的部族确实会进行迁移。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "为什么会迁移？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我试着去调查啦，但还没搞明白原因。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "西蒙娜姐说，是萨米在告诉他们，危险将至，必须迁走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "可是目前收集到的气候资料与历史记录相比没有异常，长期数据也没有表现出明显的变化趋势，萨米究竟是哪里表现出了危险呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "看来......科考科的资料......需要更新。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "嗯，萨米确实是我们的认知盲区。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "不过，萨米人好像不太喜欢被打扰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "玛丽老师，你不就一直想跟他们达成合作，但一直没成功嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "乌萨斯那边的申请流程那么冗长，要是能从萨米方向开辟进入冰原的新道路，增设科考站点，之后的科考应该都会更加方便吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "可惜萨米人......并不想让任何人进入冰原......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "对呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我刚刚......在跟玛丽老师对话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "西蒙娜姐，西蒙娜姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我刚刚——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "——那边是不是有几个人影？雪太大了，我看不清......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "麦......哲伦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "真、真的是玛丽老师吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "西蒙娜姐，我要去那边看看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "科考科主任？",
      "text": "麦哲伦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "（啊！真的是！太好了，找到你们了！我就知道你们没事！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "（奇怪，怎么......发不出声音？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "（呼，呼......心跳得好快......我，在发抖？为什么？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "（不行不行不行，我得叫住主任，把他们接回去！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "老师——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "——唔！唔唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嘘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "别听，别看，别出声。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的少女",
      "text": "我不怪你，西蒙娜，你已经好久没来这里做客了，没有感觉到它也很正常。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "呵呵......真是的，我已经是个客人了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的少女",
      "text": "没有她那么像客人，但也还是客人。你们选的登山路线，早就没什么人走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陌生的少女",
      "text": "唉，还好我每次到这边来都会绕个远路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "直到现在，那些战士还是没有接受你吗？可这片土地本身，明明将你视作心爱的孩子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......总之，多谢你出手相助，提丰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "嗯哼。报酬就不用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "我藏在这附近的食物够我度过好几个月了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "你刚刚说，你们要进入冰原，是为了找一队失踪的南方人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "那我跟你们一起走。失踪的人肯定是遇到了什么危险，我帮你一起保护这个南方来的家伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "啊——啊——欸，我可以说话了......我可以说话了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "听我解释——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "别乱动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "......为什么要把双手举起来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "呃......因为我听说，萨米人很凶，而且萨米人不喜欢让别人进入冰原。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我、我是真的没有坏心思！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "嗯？这里的战士确实挺凶的，但我不是战士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "总之，我刚刚用法术叫醒了你，但你应该还能听到那些声音，是不是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "唔......嗯，还能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "没关系，现在我知道那个是幻听了，我不会傻乎乎地跟它聊天了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "对了，这个也要写进笔记里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "你们知道这种幻听的成因吗？极端气候导致的躯体疲劳？或者本地水源含有麻痹中枢神经的成分？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "唉，耳朵侧过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "（小声）好，你说吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "好了，另一边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "好......咦，你不是要跟我讲悄悄话啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "那刚刚是什么东西在我耳朵边上蹭了一下？感觉冰冰的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "把这个压在舌头底下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "苔、苔藓和泥团？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我知道缺少食物的情况下探险家可能煮食革制品，不过确实没想过还能挖取苔藓作为应急食品......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "好，麦哲伦，你应该勇敢地试试看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "别怀疑那么多，含着它就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "这样你就只能听见自己的声音，不会被那些奇怪的杂音干扰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "是吗？你真好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "......欸，可是，这样不利于及时发现环境中的危险，还会影响攀爬时的平衡感，很危险呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "别怕，相信提丰的方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "我会和她一起，带着你走到雪没有被污染的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "嗯。到你可以把泥团吐出来的时候，我们再给你打手势。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "在那之前，不要高声说话，不要让“它”听到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "唔，那好吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年轻的科考工作者突然顿住，朝无人的方向侧过头去。\n短暂的停顿只持续了两秒，她很快依照提丰的安排，将泥团送进嘴里，就好像没有任何异常的事情发生过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "嗯，确实什么都听不见了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "停下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "欸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "雪中混杂着鼷兽的绒毛，是侦测法术。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "幸好你拉住了麦哲伦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "虽然我们无论如何都逃不过战士们的眼睛，但至少，这样我们的拜访能显得尊重一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "要让她把泥团吐出来吗？你可以把这里的情况解释给她听。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "她既然想从这里进入冰原，那应该还不知道我们眼前的北地阵线是怎么回事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "还是不必了，与那些战士的交涉，就交给我一个人吧。大部分人光是听见通用语或哥伦比亚语，恐怕就要挥动锤子将我们赶走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......啊，你瞧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "唉，来的还是“军团”的战士。那些人才不会听我们说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "寒檀木之女。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "向诸位致以问候，树痕的战士们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "您身边有一个外来人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "还有......那个背着黑弓的猎人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "请不要急着动手，这位外来者对萨米并无所求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "我们只是想借道进入无尽冰原。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萨米的战士们沉默地围住她们，没有后退一步的意思。\n他们维持着手按在武器上的姿势，一言不发，但寒檀就像是知道他们需要听到什么回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......我明白，这不合规矩，任何人都不应该贸然进入冰原。你们建起高墙，是为了拦住冰原上的灾异，也是为了拦住萨米的人与野兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "但她的恩师已经在冰原上失踪了，她救人心切......这次搜救关乎亲近之人的性命，希望各位破例放行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萨米的战士们依然没有动作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......请相信，我们会照顾好这个南方人，她不会对萨米轻举妄动，不会迷路，更不会成为你们的敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "我们与她同行，为的就是处理可能发生在她身上的，以及可能已经发生在那些失踪者身上的，最坏的情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "......信任那把黑弓？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "信任一个疯独眼巨人的女儿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "那把黑弓不能说明什么，她与你们在对抗同样的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "她的神志清醒，不代表那把武器不会引来厄运。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "曾经我们也带回每一名战士的遗物，直到我们意识到，正是这些遗物上留下的污秽引得敌人发现我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "你应该对此十分清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "——寒檀木下的西蒙娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "我已不再是萨满，但我愿意借这个身份恳求你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "我们许多人的确还记得那个将要成为雪祀的战士，只是她自己逃避了职责，我们就不打算再提起她的过往。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "她的力量尚能照顾好身边的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "冰原上失踪的队伍有十几人，在我记忆中，北地的战士原本也会为这么多条人命而通融一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "忍受命运的严苛，寒檀木之女。忍受它，别逃避。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......这是埃克提尔尼尔的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "他难道......他为整个北地占卜到了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "我不可能回答外人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "但埃克提尔尼尔已经带着许多战士前往南方，将萨米的低语告知每一个部族。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "既然萨米已经做出预言，我不会再坚持进入冰原。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "但事到如今，以我们携带的物资，已经不可能折返山脚，再取远路绕过山地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "即使邪魔的污染正在不断蔓延，我们也不得不在这片群山中继续前行，经过战士们把守的关隘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米山地斥候",
      "text": "物资？南方人心怀偏见，以至于把大地称为荒原，身处自然反而无法生存，那是他们自己的缺陷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "请各位——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "唉，走吧，西蒙娜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "你没必要向他们解释。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "你这个手势的意思是......真的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "嗯。相信我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "——等等！等一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "呜哇，嘴里苦苦的......咳咳，听我解释！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我不是什么坏人，只是个科考工作者，这个箱子里都是备用无人机，我可以现在打开给你们看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我也没有打算偷偷摸摸地进冰原，只是不知道怎么联系萨米的政府机关提交申请！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "啊，萨米有政府机关吗？到现在为止还没看见......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "不过我这里有提交给乌萨斯的文件，身份证件，探险许可，还有已经作废的路线计划书......都可以证明我真的只是科考工作者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "总之，西蒙娜姐和提丰都是好心人，不要责怪她们！你们怀疑我的话，我可以自己解释！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "还有......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不是错觉。\n随着她说的每一句话，众人的神色越来越凝重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "所有人都在看她的身后，就好像那个幻觉中的声音他们也都能听见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "你这个呆头羽，快跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "你把灾异的征兆带到了人群之中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "走这边！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "这就是你刚才说自己有把握的那条小道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "啊——好险好险，箭射在了石头上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "谢谢你，冬牙群山的石头！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "大概是在风雪中把那块岩石看成人影了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "你的法术真好用，西蒙娜。我就知道能靠你打掩护藏身。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "好了，往这边。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "背后安静了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "唔，我看看......嗯，已经看不见那些战士的身影了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "太好了，我们成功甩掉他们了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "或许......是他们没有再追上来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "不管怎么说，我们现在应该安全了吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "呼......啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "突然有点......喘不过气......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "手伸过来。我撑着你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "谢、谢谢......这些勘测设备实在太沉了，防护服也太厚重了。原本设计极北探索装备的时候，应该没考虑过要在山地上奔跑吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "......唉，我得好好道歉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我刚刚什么也听不见，只是看到你们好像在因为我而吵架，一时着急就开口大喊大叫了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "主任总叫我不要冲动，但......大概是因为我不明白为什么要害怕幻听吧，所以刚刚不够谨慎......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "不用道歉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "自然才不会跟你讲对与错呢，只有跟你亲不亲近的区别，那些北地的战士也是一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "啊，亲近......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "他们就像，唔，像连成一片的山。无论和他们说什么，都没有办法把你自己也变成山的一部分。你只能很努力地越过他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "当然，你也不能叫山改正自己，把自己变成平地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "欸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "为什么这些战士也不愿意好好沟通呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "先不说他们听不听得懂你的话，那些战士啊，平时都不需要说话吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "你看，要是我和你从早到晚生活在一起，每天要做的事情就是按照固定的方式巡逻，猎食，战斗......那就没什么可说的了呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "唔，因为太熟悉了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "不是。我们首先要有不一样的想法，才会需要沟通呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "所以我说，他们就像连成一片的山。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "而且，他们还要对付乌萨斯人呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "对他们来说，无法一眼看出想法的外来者，都值得戒备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "或许是有些冷酷，但他们不得不如此生存......（萨米语）“无论命运是何面目，承受它。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "（萨米语）命运......唔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "别在意这些了。刚刚我就跟西蒙娜打好逃跑的手势了，跟那些战士打交道，绝大多数时候只能是自己退一步，不能指望他们让步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "不过，现在我们没办法去冰原上找你的老师了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "唉，是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "接下来你打算怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我想......去察帕特求援。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "察帕特？那是萨米最南端的......城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "嗯，许多哥伦比亚公司在萨米唯一的办事处就设立在察帕特。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "现在乌萨斯进入冰原的路线封锁了，探索协会组织的搜救队肯定也只能从那里出发。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我要去跟他们会合，同时尽可能地收集这条路线上的情报。毕竟，之前大家都没有好好了解过萨米是什么样子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "那我继续保护你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "不用报酬，南方人想出来的报酬我一般都用不上。只是正好我也要去察帕特，有个委托人在那里等我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "哇，那谢谢你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "西蒙娜姐呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "当然，我答应过陪陪你的，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "欸嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "不过，提丰，这条小道通向哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "我很难想象，群山中还有战士们没有侦察出的密道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "因为这条路通向艾尔启的住处啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......独眼巨人的洞窟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "嗯，也算是我家吧，至少我是在那里长大的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "虽然，路上用萨卡兹法术做的掩饰，那些老练的萨满仔细分辨一下就能看出来，但他们也不太想去打扰独眼巨人们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "呵呵，是啊，没人会喜欢听到自己悲惨的预言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "要是那些人一直在追，我就得期待艾尔启在家，能给我们帮帮忙了。还好，他们没有那么多耐心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "但我觉得并不安心，提丰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "他们过早地停下了追击的脚步，现在倒像是我们被遗弃在风雪里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "别怕，我在盯着周围的动静。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雪在脚下嘎吱嘎吱地响着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "对了......你们说的灾异，是怎么回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "如果能够找到幻听的源头，采集样本带回莱茵进行分析，或许我们可以找到长效的抑制方法！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "没有人即刻回答麦哲伦的问题，只有靴子陷进积雪的声音越来越清晰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "这问题真奇怪，你们会觉得天灾、霜冻或者裂兽的獠牙能消失吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "灾异只是比较少见的一种麻烦，它出现了，就想办法战胜它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "唔，就像现在这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "踩入雪中的脚步声消失了，冻结的积雪不知不觉间变得轻若无物。麦哲伦眨了眨眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "是、是我又出现了幻觉吗？还是说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "......雪真的在向上飘？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "不，你没有看错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "雪正积在天空之中，悬在我们的头顶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "那......我得采集样本才行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "给我一分钟启动无人机！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "还在上升过程中的雪花......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "嘿咻，采集到了。然后是在空中悬停凝结的积雪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "——小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "积雪会下陷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "而且以视力勉强能及的范围来看，前方高空中的积雪越来越多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "继续往前走的话，恐怕砸下来的雪足以将我们三人掩埋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "这里的异象一定已经持续了一段时间，那些战士早就发现了，所以不再追。他们知道我们已经是被逼上死路的猎物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "雪祀的法术也对此束手无策......我同样无能为力，抱歉。我所呼唤的冰雪，在这里也只会向上飘去，挣脱予我力量的冻土。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "——等等，麦哲伦，回来一些！你独自走在前面会很危险！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "没关系，为了采集样本，我必须离你们稍微远一点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "如果无人机采集高空积雪时破坏了平衡，导致积雪崩落，那也只有我一个人会被埋在里面！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "——呜哇，好险啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "你感觉到了吗？雪在颤抖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "我们往前走的每一步都在叫醒它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "可那样的孩子，不该在这里停下脚步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "把手给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "很多人都很讨厌这种做法，但特殊情况下应该试一试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "对了，为了血能流到箭矢上，我得划深一点点，你应该不需要我照顾吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "尽管做吧，提丰，只要别失手划得太厉害。毕竟是滴水成冰的极寒，痛觉也会麻木的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "落雪的频率加快了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "嗯。这片土壤底下黑色的种子，认识我的弓与箭。就是因为这种事情，我才总是被人误会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "好了。还差麦哲伦——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "——麦哲伦？！快告诉我你的情况！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "啊，我没事！只是落下来的雪把山道拦住了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "等我切换到除雪模块......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "好了！你们马上就可以过来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "先把手伸过来，摘掉手套。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "欸，我做一下心理准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "——给！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "这样就可以了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "蘸过三人鲜血的箭矢刺破寒风，成块积雪轰然坠落，被钉在一侧的山崖上。那仿佛伴有嗡鸣的古怪颤动骤然停止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "......萨卡兹的巫术。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "中间的积雪不会再下落，我会用我自己的眼睛判断下一处危险，然后用同样的方式提前化解它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "继续往前走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米林地居民",
      "text": "又有好几只角兽死在了泉水附近。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米林地居民",
      "text": "明明我们已经依照萨米的意志，跨越苔原，把整个部族从群山脚下迁到了这里......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米林地居民",
      "text": "为什么依然没有摆脱灾异的侵蚀？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米林地居民",
      "text": "我们应该再占卜一次......再占卜一次吧，这片土地什么时候才能给予我们安宁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨米林地居民",
      "text": "......还是说，当时与我们同行的那个独眼巨人，说的是真的？我们的部族真的会有那样凄凉的一天吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "你之前是不是说......这是某人的住处？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "嗯，以前也是我的住处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "唉，她不在，和平时一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "可是，这这这里是岩窟欸......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "啊，西蒙娜姐又有事离开了......要是她在，应该能告诉我这一切到底正不正常......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "呃，没事！我只是在想应该怎么在笔记里描述这个地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "随便你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "来，肉干和盐，装好。艾尔启不是小气鬼，这里的东西你可以随便拿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "这样我们的物资就够撑到下山了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "谢谢你，提丰，但是先等一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我并不认识你口中的艾尔启，这怎么行......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "唔，她自己说的是：（萨卡兹语）“已被揭开帷幕的都是能够分享的事物。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "理解成她都不在乎就可以了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "欸嘿，那就谢谢啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "还有......我可以对这个洞窟的情况进行详细记录吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "我还想拍两张照片！但是我不会把东西弄乱的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "这有什么好问的？等你看够了，来火堆边休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "对了，这本笔记也是我可以翻看的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "看吧，没关系，她的笔记里都是只有她自己才懂的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "好......咦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "......对了，提丰，之前有个问题我一直忘记问了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "从逻辑上讲，幻听应该不会听见自己根本不认识的词语，或者根本没听说过的概念吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "提丰",
      "text": "唔，我不懂你的“逻辑”。怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "总之，你看，这一页。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "“一旦打开盒子，安德斯科塔尔尼尔就会觉察。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "麦哲伦",
      "text": "在你帮我隔绝周围的杂音之前，这是我听到的，主任对我说的最后一句话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "这个乌萨斯人的通讯器......能接收到讯号了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寒檀",
      "text": "只是不知道，现在收到的是多久之前的信息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断断续续的通讯音",
      "text": "......向......军团下属边防部队......报告......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "断断续续的通讯音",
      "text": "经“列巴羽”协助......“黑印”......在萨米......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
